            "remediationRecommendations": "Implement robust authentication and authorization for the `/api/companies/{companyId}/employees/{id}` PATCH endpoint. Add an `[Authorize]` attribute (or equivalent framework-specific attribute) to the `PartiallyUpdateEmployeeForCompanyAsync` method or its containing controller. Ensure that only authenticated and authorized users (e.g., administrators or users with specific roles/permissions) can modify employee records. Additionally, implement granular access control checks to ensure users can only modify employees within their permitted scope (e.g., their own company)."
